msgctxt "124"
msgid "Urgh... What the hell, man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"You're done for now. Just wait until these two finish\r\n"
"talking things through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Tagami... Take this money. Please. I can't keep going on\r\n"
"like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"My current debts have nothing to do with you. This...\r\n"
"This is all for my wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"It's cancer... She was in the hospital for surgery. All her\r\n"
"treatments cost us a near-fortune..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"We've had to work so hard for so long... All I've ever\r\n"
"wanted was for us to spend our last years together in\r\n"
"peace... Is that so much to ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But, Tagami..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "In fact, your sticky fingers led me to my wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I lost my money and had to sell the shop, as you well know.\r\n"
"Eventually, I wound up living and working in a sushi joint\r\n"
"out here in Kamurocho. That's where I met her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I did hate you once upon a time, when I was younger... But\r\n"
"why hold on to old grudges? I'm content with the way things\r\n"
"turned out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"That might be all well and good for you, but not for me!\r\n"
"Now I insist that you take this money!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Hey, collector! Here, this is yours⑬all of it. Take it and\r\n"
"never show your face around here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Yes, sir! You got it! Oh, and thanks a million... No, make\r\n"
"that ten million!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Zaizen! Why on earth did you⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Stop. I didn't give that money to you. I gave it to your\r\n"
"wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Out of pity for having to put up with a royal pain in the\r\n"
"keister like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "It's still way too much money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Then what say my drinks are on the house from now on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Well, if that's what you want... Then those drinks better be\r\n"
"damn strong! Now go introduce yourself to my wife."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "That sounds like a fine idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for all you've done. I would never\r\n"
"have been able to talk with my old friend without your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "All I did was bring you here. Nothing more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Heheheh... Live as long as I have and you can tell...\r\n"
"You're a man of no ordinary caliber. Won't you tell me your\r\n"
"name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Kiryu... Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I thank you from the bottom of my heart, Kiryu-san.\r\n"
"I'll never forget you, not as long as I live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Please accept this as a mere token of my gratitude. Now, if\r\n"
"you'll excuse me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "So this is it, eh...? This is his place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Tagami! It's me... It's Zaizen. Shintaro Zaizen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Zaizen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Zaizen... Is it really you, after all these years?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Forgive me, Tagami... I have to apologize for what I've\r\n"
"done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Back when we were working on the black market, I... I stole\r\n"
"the money we'd earned. Worse, I betrayed my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"I know this won't make up for anything I've done, but...\r\n"
"I've set aside ten million yen for you, and I want you to\r\n"
"accept it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Wait just a second. I can't take that kind of money from\r\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Tagami... Be reasonable now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"Oh? Then we'll gladly accept it on your behalf! Right,\r\n"
"Tagami-san? Heheheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"This is perfect! You owe us eight million as it is, and once\r\n"
"you tack on various fees... Well, we'll call it square at a\r\n"
"cool ten mil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Tagami... You're in debt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "You stay out of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Enough bullshit! Pay up now... or else!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"You're out of place, friend. Can't you see these men are\r\n"
"trying to have a conversation?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Who the fuck do you think you are, stickin' your nose in\r\n"
"where it don't belong!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Hey, aren't you Zaizen's buddy? Do something! Do something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"What? You got some kinda problem with how I go about doin'\r\n"
"things? Then speak up, you big chickenshit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"Don't you give me that look... Ohhh, now you're really gettin'\r\n"
"gettin' on my nerves! Now I'm itchin' to beat yer bitch ass!"
msgstr ""

